('handInitial','初始：???','Initially: ???'),('handRow','在 {i} 盖章：{before} → {after}','Stamp at {i}: {before} → {after}'),
('h1','怎样识别可以撤掉的最后一戳？','Which stamp could have been last?'),
('p1','最后一戳留下的可见字母必须全与印章吻合。在 aab 中，起点 0 的 aa 对不上 ab；起点 1 的 ab 完全吻合。倒着撤掉它，用 ? 表示已擦除、没有约束的位置，得到 a??。此时起点 0 的 a? 与 ab 不冲突，也能擦掉。擦除顺序 [1,0] 反过来就是盖章顺序 [0,1]。','Every visible letter left by the last stamp must match it. In aab, aa at start 0 conflicts with ab, while ab at start 1 matches. Remove that stamp backwards: ? means erased and unconstrained, giving a??. Now a? at start 0 has no conflict with ab and can be erased too. Reverse the erasure order [1,0] to get stamping order [0,1].'),
('observe1','选择同一例子的反向状态，再选窗口起点。逐格比较可见字母；? 允许任何印章字母。有效擦除还必须去掉至少一个新字母，否则会空转。','Choose a reverse state of the same example, then a window start. Compare visible letters cell by cell; ? permits any stamp letter. A useful erase must also remove at least one new letter, or it makes no progress.'),
