('quizExplain','起点 0 的 a、b 分别吻合 aba 的 a、b，第三格 ? 无约束，所以擦掉两个新字母。起点 1 在位置 1 的 b 对不上 a；起点 2 没有冲突却全是 ?，不带来进展。不能把 todo=0 当成一定能记一次操作。','Start 0 matches a and b to the first two letters of aba; its third cell is unconstrained. It erases two new letters. Start 1 conflicts at position 1: b versus a. Start 2 has no conflicts but only question marks, so it makes no progress. todo=0 alone does not guarantee a move worth recording.'),
('h4','怎样把“解锁”写成 Python？','How does unlocking become Python?'),
('mapping','waiting[p] 列出被位置 p 阻塞的窗口，todo[i] 数窗口 i 还剩几个冲突。建表的双循环登记每个不等字符。done[p] 保证一个位置只擦一次，因此它的依赖也只通知一次。deque 是两端队列；append 在尾部加入，popleft 从头部取出，均为 O(1)。answer[::-1] 新建倒序列表，把撤销顺序改成盖章顺序。','waiting[p] lists windows blocked by position p; todo[i] counts remaining conflicts for window i. The setup loops register each mismatch. done[p] ensures each position is erased once, so its dependencies are notified once. deque is a double-ended queue: append adds at the tail and popleft removes the head, both O(1). answer[::-1] creates a reversed list, converting undo order into stamping order.'),
('cost','设 m=len(stamp)、n=len(target)。建表 O(nm)；每个窗口至多入队一次，扫描 m 格；每条不匹配依赖只更新一次。因此总时间 O(nm)，waiting 最坏 O(nm)，其余 O(n)；返回答案 O(n)。m=n 时只有一个窗口，必须完全相等；m=1 时所有目标字母必须等于印章字母。相同字母可产生重叠空操作，代码会跳过。','Let m=len(stamp), n=len(target). Setup costs O(nm). Each window enters the queue at most once and scans m cells; each mismatch dependency is updated once. Total time is O(nm), waiting uses up to O(nm) space, and the rest O(n); output uses O(n). When m=n there is one window and the strings must match exactly. When m=1 every target letter must equal the stamp letter. Repeated letters may produce overlapping no-op windows, which the code skips.'),
